This section contains definitions of census terms and provides explanations which may be required
to understand the census results in this publication. Most definitions included here are based on the
questions in the census questionnaires and on the methodology applied in the various phases of the
census process. The main concepts and definitions are detailed below.
Population: The population in this report corresponds to the de-facto population of Myanmar on Census
      ...
or the most responsible member of a household in order to determine the number and characteristics of
all persons and households in the country at a given time. The collection of this information is carried out
through the completion of questionnaires for every conventional household and every institution.
